WEBVTT

00:03:28.173 --> 00:03:32.210
People often ask me
what I learned from that time.

00:03:32.234 --> 00:03:34.446
Well, obviously it changed things.

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:38.460
Let's face it, becoming a celibate monk
is going to change a number of things.

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:40.732
But it was more than that.

00:03:41.064 --> 00:03:44.379
It taught me -- it gave me
a greater appreciation,

00:03:44.403 --> 00:03:47.625
an understanding for the present moment.

00:03:48.062 --> 00:03:51.998
By that I mean not being lost in thought,

00:03:52.022 --> 00:03:53.834
not being distracted,

00:03:53.858 --> 00:03:57.649
not being overwhelmed
by difficult emotions,

00:03:57.673 --> 00:04:01.202
but instead learning how to be
in the here and now,